      "side": 1,
      "message": "We can\u0027t guarantee that the git directory is available.  Some vendors use source control that is not git, and our build infrastructure will delete the .git directories locally if they are running low on disk space.  There is also no guarantee that git is in the path.  I\u0027d prefer if this computed the hash of the directory contents, which would line up with the git tree objects.  That could be very complicated to match git exactly though.",
      "revId": "55120fe8e2db31ab66d3047f5cb436b49ccee9e3",
      "serverId": "85c56323-6fa9-3386-8a01-6480fb634889"
    },
